  "notes": [
    "This file lists the coded fields used in the UAT API request and normalized bureau response.",
    "The response sample provides normalized bureau report data generated from source bureau JSON.",
    "Exact source score is not exposed; score is returned as a range such as 740-745. If source score is -1, response returns -1.",
    "Raw source/provider JSON, control numbers, lender/member names, and unmasked identifiers are not included in the normalized response."
  ],
